{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/784049-soundtrack-what-s-your-mage-soundtrack","id":784049,"title":"[Soundtrack] What's your Mage soundtrack?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-11T04:05:22-08:00","id":784049,"title":"[Soundtrack] What's your Mage soundtrack?","content":"Here's a new one that I can't help but imagine as a <b>Mage </b>theme:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=u9Dg-g7t2l4\" data-code=\"u9Dg-g7t2l4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/u9Dg-g7t2l4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Imagine the trials of a Wise mage struggling against the hubris and ignorance of others, viewing the horrors that lie within the human soul and in the shadows of the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Five Finger Death Punch</u></b><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=He4YV1uqwfs\" target=\"_blank\">Wrong Side of Heaven</a> - Another good one for the descent into hubris and crumbling Wisdom.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Trivium</u></b><br /> These guys work as well for <b>Werewolf </b>as anything, but a lot of their tunes are into heavy mythology, tragedy, and human-wrought disaster. The Awakened have opened their eyes enough to see the Truth, and everything that stands to drown it in folly and greed.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=slnzpNRPGsQ\" target=\"_blank\">No Way to Heal</a> - What have you sacrificed\u2014or taken\u2014in the pursuit of your Obsessions? Will you explode like a star going nova as the disaster you set in motion crashed down about you, or will you shake the firmament to right what you have done?<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8h33AHzH41A\" target=\"_blank\">To Believe</a> - Pentacle mages against the Seers of the Throne.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=63GpmCSL7Og\" target=\"_blank\">Down From the Sky</a> - War against the Abyss and the Exarchs! War against the very hubris that fuels wars....<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MubyrFQkfck\" target=\"_blank\">Throes of Perdition</a> - What's it feel like to be Awake in a world of Sleeping fools?<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IuWZ2HNd2VM\" target=\"_blank\">Black</a> - Behold the Abyss and despair.<br /> <br /> <b><u>Evanescence</u></b><br /> Maybe a bit of a World of Darkness cliche, but they have some killer tunes, many of which apply to <b>Mage: the Awakening</b>. For example:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OTLzWGIL-iI\" target=\"_blank\">What You Want</a> - An Awakened theme if I've ever heard one.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w7apWr6hz4U\" target=\"_blank\">Everybody's Fool</a> - What's the greater Lie: the Lie itself, or the lies you tell yourself as you mold this Fallen World to fulfill your desires?<br /> <br /> And those are just a few selections. What does your <b>Mage: the Awakening </b>soundtrack look like?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T12:38:50-08:00","id":784288,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=37eEUsd1ASA\" target=\"_blank\">Data - Don't Sing</a><br /> <br /> To me this song is about the Arrow and the fight against the lie, a lyric from the chorus: Wake up to the sign of drums, don't sing about the love, think about the rhythm, sing about war.<br /> My interpretation is that everyone always wants to make happy lies to keep their lives going, but the truth is that you should get up and fight them. Don't make &quot;happy&quot; things just because they are happy, things should be confronted even if unpleasant.<br /> <br /> You should probably have to watch the video twice to fully get it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T14:19:19-08:00","id":784351,"title":"","content":"Every time I see the music video for Transcendence by Lindsey Stirling, I can't help but think of Mage.<br /> <br /> The visuals are perfect with the way projections are used to create this illusion of reality being a great metaphor for how 'the lie' works. The man using it to control her seems like a good example of what the Exarchs/Seers of the Throne want to do with the lie. The moment when she sees through it all, spots the projector and the lie starts breaking down around her makes me think of an awakening.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how to format the link how everyone else has above but you can watch it here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EiyPRqP5glY\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EiyPRqP5glY</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T15:01:45-08:00","id":784368,"title":"","content":"&quot;A Kind of Magic&quot; by Queen. That's the perfect Mage song, in my opinion.<br /> <br /> One dream, one soul, one prize<br /> One goal, one golden glance of what should be<br /> It's a kind of magic<br /> One shaft of light that shows the way<br /> No mortal man can win this day<br /> It's a kind of magic<br /> The bell that rings inside your mind<br /> It's challenging the doors of time<br /> It's a kind of magic<br /> The waiting seems eternity<br /> The day will dawn on sanity<br /> Is this a kind of magic<br /> It's a kind of magic<br /> There can be only one<br /> This rage that lasts a thousand years<br /> Will soon be gone<br /> This flame that burns inside of me<br /> I'm hearing secret harmonies<br /> It's a kind of magic<br /> The bell that rings inside your mind<br /> It's challenging the doors of time","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10065-zolace","name":"Zolace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T15:11:01-08:00","id":784372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zolace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/784049-soundtrack-what-s-your-mage-soundtrack?p=784368#post784368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;A Kind of Magic&quot; by Queen. That's the perfect Mage song, in my opinion.</div> </div> </div> </div>The whole Highlander soundtrack by Queen actually had some good Mage qualities I think. Princes of the Universe was great for capturing the hubris of Mages. Who wants to live forever was good for the isolation from the rest of the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T15:48:19-08:00","id":784391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael Kenner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/784049-soundtrack-what-s-your-mage-soundtrack?p=784372#post784372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The whole Highlander soundtrack by Queen actually had some good Mage qualities I think. Princes of the Universe was great for capturing the hubris of Mages. Who wants to live forever was good for the isolation from the rest of the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, very much so. I think you hit the nail on the head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10065-zolace","name":"Zolace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-11T16:54:51-08:00","id":784410,"title":"","content":"Lights and Thunder by Krewella. Its lyrics fit a theme of waiting for what you know is missing, a &quot;spark&quot; within yourself. <br /> <br /> 1996 by Marilyn Manson. A Mastigos or Antinomian way of transgression through shock and deconstructing accepted and positive social constructs. <br /> <br /> Mowgli's Road by Marina and the Diamonds. A ballad that fits more Changeling than Mage, but still a good one. Escape, madness, and chains enforced by silver spoons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T01:10:48-08:00","id":784602,"title":"","content":"Out of Phase from Parasite Eve is very atmospheric. Pleasant sounding, but with a sinister undertone. Very evocative title, too. I've always seen Mage Sight as something oppressive hanging over the heads of the Awakened, and that's what the song reminds me of. Whether you want to or not, you'll eventually find yourself pulled back into the world of magic by powers and feelings you can't ignore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7925,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7925-rdmarquis","user":"RdMarquis","date":". 12-12-2015, 04:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7925-rdmarquis","name":"RdMarquis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-12T01:18:18-08:00","id":784605,"title":"","content":"I absolutely <i>love</i> OST topics! For games I strive rather for pieces without words or not easily understandable, so mine player will be less taken out the rhythm of the game at table. Here are mine main recommendations for <b>Mage</b>, just take from mine game playlist. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Let\u2019s start with mood music. We want to build atmosphere for the game.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i>Arcana</i></b></span><br /> Great Swedish project for setting feel of ancient Mysteries and rituals in the woods or just outside of the block. All of their music is good for game sessions OST, but this one is extremly fitting for the Awakening itself or some ancient ritual to commerce. Best High Speech ever! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eQ4IqfUPFv0\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eQ4IqfUPFv0\" data-code=\"eQ4IqfUPFv0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/eQ4IqfUPFv0/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> <b><i>Sephiroth</i></b> <b><i>&amp; Ulf S\u00f6derberg</i></b><br /> Sephiroth is Ulf\u2019s project and his music is very fitting for dark whisperers and impulses of Abyss. Just read his Last.FM sum up:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> He relates stories about the inexorable and destructive power of Time, mankind's futile attempts of resistance, and the sunken cities, fallen towers, and overgrown ruins that this has resulted in. Dark eerie soundscapes and ritualistic drums are combined with his own field recordings from places like Cairo, Iceland, and gloomy Nordic forests.<br /> Ulf's music whispers about the Gods we are desperately trying to appease, only to find ourselves dying before the monuments we spent our lives building. Ulf bids you welcome into the ruins and down to the deep forgotten catacombs. </div> </div> </div>For the little snipet of his works \u2013 I give you great toon for the descending in to place marked by the Void, maybe Abyssal Verge. Imagine going down, and down \u2013 in to great unknown, filled with wrongness\u2026<br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rpyJg2GF7GQ\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rpyJg2GF7GQ\" data-code=\"rpyJg2GF7GQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/rpyJg2GF7GQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> <b><i>Samael </i></b>( Album <i>Solar Soul</i> )<br /> This project had many phases, but <i>Solar Soul</i>-one is interesting us. It\u2019s great tracks for dynamic understanding of Mysteries and action scenes. It\u2019s like <b>Samael</b>, as band, was Mastigos Libertine group that wanted to force Awakenings on the world all around them. This one song is especially good on tyrany of Exarchs and traitors from Seers of Throne. Your soul and mind is saved \u2013 your welcome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aMzWysnhr5c\" data-code=\"aMzWysnhr5c\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/aMzWysnhr5c/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <b><i>Harry Potter\u2019s films and Assasin\u2019s Creed video games OST</i></b><br /> <br /> I found those two OST series very fitting to the general Mage mood setters. Potter films make great atmosphere builder for the \u201cold magic\u201d ( but not of Times Before, this will be later ), like ancient or medival magic, espcially Mysterium\u2019s and Silver Ladder\u2019s. Used lately on the Caucuss of the first one. J Assassin\u2019s Creed, on the other hand, are great for general ambient and marking the game as modern one, with roots of ancient history that \u201cbleeds\u201d through Time to our nights. Just listen this\u2026<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/a7z8HGXVR80\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a7z8HGXVR80\" data-code=\"a7z8HGXVR80\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/a7z8HGXVR80/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/4X0vsmqfdSA\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4X0vsmqfdSA\" data-code=\"4X0vsmqfdSA\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/4X0vsmqfdSA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a><br /> <br /> <b><i>Bonus: All Along The Watchtower ( Battlestar Galactica Version )</i></b><br /> Great pice of music for summoning the Watchtowers call in the modern times. Dream imagery, old sounding parts like from Oracle of Delphi, all composed in the modern song vibrating with souls of humans. Great track for the Awakening itself and more Supernal encounters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BigolJfoANw\" data-code=\"BigolJfoANw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/BigolJfoANw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> More to come...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-13T09:42:46-08:00","id":785443,"title":"","content":"Welcome to the Machine by Pink Floyd could be sung by Mammon, if Exarchs are capable of singing.<br /> <br /> &quot;What did you dream? It's all right, we told you what to dream.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9001,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","user":"solidork","date":". 12-13-2015, 02:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T08:41:21-08:00","id":785996,"title":"","content":"Mine includes a lot of They Might Be Giants. Because of the way they like to mix disturbing lyrics with light hearted melodies and vice versa they've got a very altered reality feel to them. Token Back to Brooklyn in particular sounds a lot like a Mastigos Mystery Play.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C9GRBO_gXcE\" data-code=\"C9GRBO_gXcE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/C9GRBO_gXcE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T08:50:25-08:00","id":786005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramnesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/784049-soundtrack-what-s-your-mage-soundtrack?p=785996#post785996\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mine includes a lot of They Might Be Giants. Because of the way they like to mix disturbing lyrics with light hearted melodies and vice versa they've got a very altered reality feel to them. Token Back to Brooklyn in particular sounds a lot like a Mastigos Mystery Play.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C9GRBO_gXcE\" data-code=\"C9GRBO_gXcE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/C9GRBO_gXcE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Some seer quotes from their songs:<br /> <br /> &quot;Nobody on the world ever gets what they want and that is beautiful.<br /> Everybody dies frustrated and sad and that is beautiful.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't want the world, I just want your half.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Kiss me, Son of God&quot; could be the Paternoster ministry's theme song. &quot;I built a little empire out of some crazy garbage called the blood of the exploited working class. But they've overcome their shyness and they're calling me your Highness and the world screams &quot;Kiss me, Son of God!&quot;<br /> <br /> The song &quot;No one knows my plan&quot; is about escaping from jail and directly references Plato's allegory of the cave, which makes it pretty good.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":9001,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","user":"solidork","date":". 12-15-2015, 01:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-14T16:41:12-08:00","id":786342,"title":"","content":"Tool's album Lateralus (especially the title track) is full of Awakening deliciousness:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_tcW-j7KFgY\" data-code=\"_tcW-j7KFgY\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_tcW-j7KFgY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> It's worth having a look at <a href=\"http://www.azlyrics.com/lyrics/tool/lateralus.html\" target=\"_blank\">the lyrics</a>, too.<br /> <br /> Other good tracks from that album include <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2bKy57OeNU8\" target=\"_blank\">Parabola</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T0jH96EFkw4\" target=\"_blank\">Schism</a>. :<br /> <br /> Nine Inch Nails have done a bunch of songs that have a Free Council-ish feel, but could apply to some of the other Orders too:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cV2EUUF47Ms\" target=\"_blank\">Head Like A Hole</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xwhBRJStz7w\" target=\"_blank\">The Hand That Feeds</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ysFxrPNjvNA\" target=\"_blank\">Every Day Is Exactly The Same</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4855-eggs-maledict","name":"Eggs Maledict","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T14:43:01-08:00","id":787637,"title":"","content":"I imagine the Val Royeaux theme fits the Silver Ladder, perhaps specifically an Obrimos Silver Ladder member maybe.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRWe-igolq4\" data-code=\"rRWe-igolq4\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/rRWe-igolq4/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:28px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">\u263e</span></span></b></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/438-wulf","name":"wulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar438_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-16T17:08:45-08:00","id