gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T09:43:54-08:00","id":794230,"title":"","content":"I'm not really a person that should talk about music but this song has always fealt Mage'y for me:<br /> [ur]https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LxBKsbcSXGo[/url]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T15:46:04-08:00","id":794428,"title":"","content":"No one's mentioning &quot;wake up&quot; from Rage against the Machine ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1851-jps","name":"JPS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T19:47:25-08:00","id":794564,"title":"","content":"Song about trying - literally - to understand a Sleep and Awakening by that, anyone? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AoHHmGkpjoc\" data-code=\"AoHHmGkpjoc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/AoHHmGkpjoc/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> There is even Atlantis reference as &quot;Zion&quot;... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-21T18:43:55-07:00","id":895804,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://youtube.com/watch?v=_8d1Dsklzu8\" target=\"_blank\">Nerves, by Icon For Hire</a>- This feels like a good song to describe a Libertine who's started to grow frustrated with Sleepers. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://youtube.com/watch?v=4nYmpMbKM-A\" target=\"_blank\">Cynics and Critics</a>, by the same band, however, is a good examination of the darker side of the Assembly, what happens when mob mentality drowns out common sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T05:52:39-07:00","id":963650,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nak4OVJlhAU\" target=\"_blank\">Awake O Sleeper. by the Brothers Bright</a><br /> <br /> I play Obrimos a lot okay.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T06:15:20-07:00","id":963660,"title":"","content":"I prefer instrumental soundtracks, it keeps you focused on the actual story, among other reasons. I've found that Blake Neely's OST's for The Flash and Legends of Tomorrow are especially fitting for a chronicle full of 'heroic action'. (I also tend to associate them with Obrimos. The Speed Force - &quot;controlling all motion and progression&quot; - Aether much? Or at least as close as possible for a comic-based story.)<br /> <br /> Case in point:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ECfY1DDsIvc\" data-code=\"ECfY1DDsIvc\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ECfY1DDsIvc/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Also, timetravelling chronicle that uses Dark Eras. Don't tell me you haven't considered it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5973,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","user":"Prometheus","date":". 09-05-2016,